    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12383602/comment/12547053",
          "id": "12547053",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=aschrijvers",
            "name": "aschrijvers",
            "key": "aschrijvers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ard Schrijvers",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Repeated from user-list: \n\nIt seems that in LuceneQueryBuilder at\n\nObject visit(TextsearchQueryNode node, Object data) {\n\nit breaks at\n\nQuery context = parser.parse(query.toString()); \n\nwhere the parser is o.a.j.core.query.lucene.fulltext.QueryParser. It seems to break on string ending with a \"!\". Unfortunately, I do not have insight in how the QueryParser works. Perhaps somebody else knows where to look in the QueryParser .",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=aschrijvers",
            "name": "aschrijvers",
            "key": "aschrijvers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Ard Schrijvers",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-11-30T09:26:10.804+0000",
          "updated": "2007-11-30T09:26:10.804+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12383602/comment/12547155",
          "id": "12547155",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
            "key": "mreutegg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "In addition to the already specified set of special character in JSR 170, Jackrabbit uses more of those characters for extended functionality.\n\nThis set of characters should be limited to the ones really required (e.g. ! is equivalent to -) and clearly documented. It would be nice to also have a utility class that automatically escapes the special characters used in Jackrabbit.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
            "key": "mreutegg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "created": "2007-11-30T14:30:03.821+0000",
          "updated": "2007-11-30T14:30:03.821+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12383602/comment/12640952",
